Require:
  - :equality
Predicate:
  + (equal object object)
Action:
  - debark: ?p - object ?a - object ?c - object
      pre: (and (aircraft ?a) (at ?a ?c) (city ?c) (in ?p ?a) (not (= ?p ?a)) (person ?p))
      eff: (and (at ?p ?c) (not (in ?p ?a)))
  + debark: ?p - object ?a - object ?c - object
      pre: (and (aircraft ?a) (at ?a ?c) (city ?c) (in ?p ?a) (not (equal ?p ?a)) (person ?p))
      eff: (and (at ?p ?c) (not (in ?p ?a)))
Init:
  + (equal city0 city0)
  + (equal city1 city1)
  + (equal city2 city2)
  + (equal city3 city3)
  + (equal city4 city4)
  + (equal fl0 fl0)
  + (equal fl1 fl1)
  + (equal fl2 fl2)
  + (equal fl3 fl3)
  + (equal fl4 fl4)
  + (equal fl5 fl5)
  + (equal fl6 fl6)
  + (equal person1 person1)
  + (equal person2 person2)
  + (equal person3 person3)
  + (equal person4 person4)
  + (equal person5 person5)
  + (equal person6 person6)
  + (equal person7 person7)
  + (equal person8 person8)
  + (equal plane1 plane1)
  + (equal plane2 plane2)
  + (equal plane3 plane3)
Pred prop:
  - (= object object): in_pre in_pre_neg
  + (equal object object): in_init in_pre in_pre_neg
Global prop:
  - has_eq_pred
